Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: Set of functions to draw 'ggplot2' graphics (boxplots, scatterplots, donuts, heatmaps, Miami plots, raster layers, color palettes and justification helpers), written according to the safer-r project recommendations for R function development (see <https://github.com/safer-r>). This includes strict checking of argument values, explicit package namespace qualification of all the called functions and explicit writing of all their arguments, among other things.
